#!/usr/bin/env rexx
/*
   Name:    "1-200_listFonts.rxj"
   Invoke:  "rexx 1-200_listFonts.rxj"
            "rexxj 1-200_listFonts.rxj" (Windows)
            "rexxj.sh 1-200_listFonts.rxj" (Unix)

   Purpose:  Lists all font families installed on the system.

   Date:    2022-10-03

   Author:  Rony G. Flatscher, WU Vienna

   Changes: --

   last change: Revision: $Revision: 951 $ $Author: orexx $ $Date: 2022-08-10 18:06:25 +0200 (Mi., 10 Aug 2022) $
                (svn hint: use 'propset svn:keywords "Author Date Revision" filename')

   license:

    ------------------------ Apache Version 2.0 license -------------------------
